# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# Extended production-bank coverage: 60 minutes across all twenty scenes,
# followed by 12 minutes with the four appended Lead instruments.
# Host simulation checks output headroom and continued output; it does not
# measure physical FM-1 deadlines, USB stability or audible sound quality.
